OCGRAPH 1
# Visual scripting graph, written by the Aver Engine editor.
NAME CrossImplementationTest
DESCRIPTION Written by the C++ writer, parsed and executed by the C# runtime

NODE c1 ConstFloat 0 0
NODE c2 ConstFloat 0 100
NODE c3 ConstFloat 0 200
NODE sum Add 200 50
NODE prod Multiply 400 100

PIN c1 value out float 5
PIN c2 value out float 7
PIN c3 value out float 3
PIN sum a in float
PIN sum b in float
PIN sum result out float
PIN prod a in float
PIN prod b in float
